              "am wear",
              "will wear",
              "going to wear"
            ],
            "c": 2,
            "expl": "مضارع (rains) في جملة الشرط → will + فعل في جملة الجواب: <strong>will wear</strong>.",
            "id": "q_grammar_3_001"
          },
          {
            "q": "If I …… you, I would accept the offer.",
