              "be",
              "am",
              "been",
              "were"
            ],
            "c": 3,
            "expl": "would accept = حالة ثانية تخيلية → نستخدم <strong>were</strong>.",
            "id": "q_grammar_3_002"
          },
          {
            "q": "If he …… harder, he would have passed.",
